<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the progress of harvest on August 26.</p>
<p>	   PCT IN SWATH	  PCT COMBINED</p>
<p>CROP    AUG 26 91/95 AVG    AUG 26 91/95 AVG</p>
<p>w.wheat  17     20	     73     57</p>
<p>s.wheat  10     19		2	5</p>
<p>durum    10     16		1	7</p>
<p>oats	8     16		2	6</p>
<p>barley   14     23		3     12</p>
<p>fall rye  9     19	     80     76</p>
<p>s.rye    15     34	     39     15</p>
<p>flax	0	2		0	0</p>
<p>canola   31     38		4	8</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
